# The BeIR corpora this experiment screens on are public downloads, pinned by repository,
# revision and sha256 in sources.json, and re-fetched by prepare-data.py. They are kept out of
# Git deliberately rather than by accident: about 10 MB of parquet, tsv and zip that any run can
# re-derive and whose digests a run verifies. All six pins were checked against the files on disk
# on 2026-11-01 and all six matched.
*.parquet
*.tsv
*.zip
